{"title":"Emberfang's Heart","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 63 Fire Elemental that attacks with burn (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/emberfang-heart\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/emberfang-heart?lv=63\">Lv 63</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/emberfang-heart?lv=65\">Lv 65 <span>29</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/emberfang-heart?lv=68\">Lv 68 <span>30</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/emberfang-heart?lv=69\">Lv 69 <span>8</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/emberfang-heart?lv=63\" title=\"Pick level 63\"><td><b>63</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>476</td><td>39.2</td><td>3,150</td><td class=\"muted\">1,428 · 54.9 · 9,450</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/emberfang-heart?lv=65\" title=\"Pick level 65\"><td><b>65</b></td><td>490</td><td>40.3</td><td>3,250</td><td class=\"muted\">1,470 · 56.4 · 9,750</td><td>29</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/emberfang-heart\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>68</b></td><td>511</td><td>41.9</td><td>3,400</td><td class=\"muted\">1,533 · 58.7 · 10,200</td><td>30</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/emberfang-heart?lv=69\" title=\"Pick level 69\"><td><b>69</b></td><td>518</td><td>42.5</td><td>3,450</td><td class=\"muted\">1,554 · 59.5 · 10,350</td><td>8</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>What it can drop</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/42f74c164b26deff4eb1.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/heartbreaker-warmace\"><b>Heartbreaker</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Titanium Warmace, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">+3% damage for each hit in a row on the same target, up to +15%.</span></li><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/1d2e48e084e8ea17357b.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/last-ember-longbow\"><b>The Last Ember</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Shagbark Longbow, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">Critical hits set the target and up to 4 other monsters within 1.5 tiles of it burning.</span></li><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/4b10a1b4003b700566bc.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/keepers-sluice-staff\"><b>The Keeper&#39;s Sluice</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Shagbark Staff, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">Your spells cast 8% faster.</span></li>\n      <li><b>Gear every kill:</b> a piece from its tier, excellent or better, and a second piece 1 kill in 5.</li>\n      <li><b>Gold</b> worth about 5 ordinary kills.</li>\n      <li><b>Enchanted:</b> 1 kill in 100 enchants a piece (up to 9c, and only what its material can hold).</li>\n      <li><b>Elite:</b> a boss spawns elite 1 time in 100, and an elite makes its unique 5 times as likely.</li></ul>\n      <p class=\"muted\">From the game’s rules and its own guide. See <a href=\"#/guide/unique-items\">Unique items</a>.</p>\n      <h2>Drops players have recorded</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 4 recorded drops, 1,175 total, 203–343 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×203–343</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ember-core\" title=\"Ember Core - in 3 of 4 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 8 total, 2–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/f51fcc7dea071d81fbeb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ember Core</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×2–3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"lizper-feet\" title=\"Lizper Feet - in 2 of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/32c045dadd9ca37ea76c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lizper Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 2 of 2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gem-ruby\" title=\"Gem Ruby - in 2 of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c3be065d1945333c2808.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gem Ruby</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+7 more\">+7 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"thorn-feet\" title=\"Thorn Feet - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c545c7eb5d27184e604d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thorn Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"thorn-torso\" title=\"Thorn Torso - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/9f21d42474f8d7e3fe4d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thorn Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"lizper-legs\" title=\"Lizper Legs - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/639e656beda54ecb8321.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lizper Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-dagger\" title=\"Titanium Dagger - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/76a2e17f4e9945d67b1f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Dagger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-rapier\" title=\"Titanium Rapier - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/90842e1c199f494d84dd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Rapier</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-legs\" title=\"Titanium Legs - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/4e6f73bfebe5438ee961.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-fullhelm\" title=\"Titanium Fullhelm - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ecb5ddd419cbbf5c9850.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Fullhelm</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Molten Heart</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 67</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6305\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/the-emberfang-s-heart\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/5e68e9d0b6af82b39346.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>The Emberfang&#39;s Heart</b><span>Lv 65–69</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Fire Elemental: <a href=\"#/monster/dryback\">Dryback</a> <span class=\"muted\">(60)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/cinderling\">Cinderling</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/magma-elemental\">Magma Elemental</a> <span class=\"muted\">(64)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/molten-colossus\">Molten Colossus</a> <span class=\"muted\">(65)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/cinder-heart\">Cinder Heart</a> <span class=\"muted\">(66)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/bdee165a337899cad706.svg\" alt=\"Emberfang&#39;s Heart\"></div><h3>Emberfang&#39;s Heart</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>68</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 63)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Fire Elemental</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>burn · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>511</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>41.9</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3,400</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>4</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>4 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}